  m_text: If a            does not trigger the Free Spins Feature, then that          
    may add 10x-100x Current Bet to the MEGA, GRAND, MAJOR, MAXI, MINOR or MINI meter
    for the active bet option. \n\nIf a            does not trigger the Free Spins
    Feature, then the           may add 15 wilds to the            meter for the
    active bet option. \n\nIf a            does not trigger the Free Spins Feature,
    then the           meter shows the number of wilds as 75, then that           
    instead may add 25 wilds to the             meter for the active bet option.\n         
    meter can display a maximum of 100 wilds.
